Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIRENS WAlLlNG IN DlSTANCE]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOGS BARKING]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.17,0:00:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[PEOPLE SHOUTING lN SPANlSH]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[MUSlC PLAYlNG IN CAR STEREO]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.18,0:00:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?\NHow's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.13,0:01:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, you buying\Nor you just stopping to envy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Punk bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,AUTOMATED FEMALE VOlCE:\NPlease leave your message\Nfor 505-1 27-5223.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.94,0:02:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Record your message after the tone.\NTo send a numeric page--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bounce, little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.45,0:02:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, Skinny, l'm up on 2nd and\NHazeltine, getting eyeballed hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.16,0:02:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got a bad feeling, man.\NI need some backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your ass up here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.46,0:02:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that thing in your ear?\NWhat did I say? Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.75,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[HORN HONKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUN COCKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[GUNSHOT]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.94,0:02:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[EXHALES]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.58,0:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[GURGLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,DELCAVOLl:\NWell, Walt, we've made\Nsuch headway with your treatments
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,that now it's time we talked about\Nsealing the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.12,0:03:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.58,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.17,0:03:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,my initial diagnosis was\Nthat your cancer was inoperable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That may no longer be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We think now that a lobectomy\Nmay be a viable option.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a pretty good option.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dr. Bravenec is one of\Nthe few surgeons in the country
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,performing lobectomies\Nafter full-dosage radiation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a good track record.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.90,0:04:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,\N\Naggressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.78,0:04:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Very much so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.57,0:04:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand that\Nif you don' t have this surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.58,0:04:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you' re just waiting\Nfor the cancer to spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Through the treatment you've had,\Nwe've bought you some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a lot, probably a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,if you're willing to take some risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,then this offers the best chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[CLEARS THROAT]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.44,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How much would it cost?\NI mean, I'm not on your insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.69,0:04:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd say between 1 70-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.69,0:04:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,and 200,000, all in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:05:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,For my part, I'd be willing\Nto write off what l can
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,but mine isn't even\Nthe biggest expense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,This is obviously a big decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and you folks are gonna wanna\Ntake some time to discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.43,0:05:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERlNG]\NUm... Walt, don't you think we should
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.77,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,at least talk this through first?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I just think it's the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.19,0:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, have to say,\NI think it's the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I recommend\Nthat we let the pneumonitis heal
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,for another couple of weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and then we' ll have at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, that's tricky. l, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.67,0:05:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,BRAVENEC:\NWhen's the due date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.05,0:05:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the, uh, 21 st.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So two weeks and change?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.88,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. l'll book the surgery\Nfor four weeks from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That way Walter can be on his feet\Nfor the birth of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't wait any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[QUlETLY]\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[LOCK CLICKS]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourteen messages...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE: Yeah.\NIt's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell were you?\Nl called, like, 20 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Working.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.18,0:06:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Combo's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.73,0:06:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You did not just say that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse, listen--\NThat figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the word on the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's dropping no names.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.71,0:07:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Combo rang me before it went down,\Nsaid dudes were mad-dogging him,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.09,0:07:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to run him up off the corner.\NThat's all l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd we have to go pushing\Ninto new turf, yo? l mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,what'd you expect?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.14,0:07:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do right by Combo's people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.74,0:07:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But make sure you bust up your cell\Nand toss it, all right?\NWe' ll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.62,0:07:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate what\Nyou' re saying and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.46,0:08:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but with Combo gone\Nand Badger laying low out in Cali...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.88,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on probation, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Fast track to Los Lunas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.05,0:08:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re on the verge
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.22,0:08:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,of making some serious coin,\NSkinny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you're gonna jump ship now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This game we playing? We don't got\Nthe street cred to survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.61,0:08:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when everyone thought\Nyou killed Spooge,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.11,0:08:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,maybe we were doing okay,\Nbut that whole
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.53,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,thing to the head thing, the ATM?\NYeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.70,0:08:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,His junkie bitch copped to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Whole town knows it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.30,0:08:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say something?\NI don't know, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we like you and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, just sit tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll get by.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:09:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? We'll make it.\NSorry, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.94,0:09:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.65,0:09:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS THEN CLOSES]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We have had a bit of a setback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.04,0:09:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry but that's\Nan accurate description.\NWhat else do you want me to call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.79,0:09:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How about "your fault"?\NNo, no, don't lay that on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in charge of distribution.\NYou said expand the territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't mean you become careless.\NGuys, guys! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I look like Maury Povich?\NI'm not your marriage counselor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you're professionals.\NAct like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.72,0:09:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, setback. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,One of our dealers was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was some kind of turf dispute,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and apparently we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And then everyone quit on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,\Nwe have absolutely no distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.74,0:09:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any way any of this\Ncan be traced back to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the police, l'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.46,0:10:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, there's your silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.42,0:10:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How about you?\NHow's the, uh, health situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's, uh, better. Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.89,0:10:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's looking a little more positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.23,0:10:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have more time than l thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Outstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, as to your dead guy:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.74,0:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, occupational hazard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Drug dealer getting shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go out on a limb here\Nand say it's been known to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what about product on hand?\NHow's your inventory?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight and change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight ounces? Grams?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You did say make hay\Nwhile the sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]\NGuys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.39,0:10:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the long faces here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.47,0:11:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re sitting on a gold mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A gold mine we can't sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.10,0:11:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We need a proper infrastructure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.60,0:11:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We need foot soldiers\Nand we need dealers
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,on a street level\Nthat are rock solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We need muscle\Nand we need enforcers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.49,0:11:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Payback. That' s what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, this entire process\Nhas just been so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always been one step forward\Nand two steps back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.01,0:11:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, let's start with\Nsome tough love, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.52,0:11:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for this? Here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You two suck at peddling meth.\NPeriod.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So give up on trying\Nto do it all yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, I'm amazed you got this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.82,0:11:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we are not going to deal with\Nanother high-level distributor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:12:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.\NWe have been down that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.87,0:12:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What, some tattooed speed freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No. What you two need\Nis an honest-to-God businessman.\NAll right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody who treats your product
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.33,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,like the simple\Nhigh-margin commodity that it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody who ships out of town,\Ndeals only in bulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone who's been doing this\Nfor 20 years and never been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.85,0:12:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You know someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I know a guy\Nwho knows a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.90,0:12:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows another guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make some calls,\Nsee if I can get you a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.78,0:12:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.53,0:12:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's very low profile.\NHe's careful like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.54,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nfrom what l do hear about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.87,0:12:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,he sounds a little like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,ANNOUNCER [OVER TV]:\NAnd McDonald tabletops it, lands it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He' s coming to the end\Nand he' s got the big fist pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Mueller's coming.\NOh, a double! Here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's coming to the end\Nand he takes second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.69,0:13:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[TURNS TV OFF]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.57,0:13:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,some stuff about me\Nyou don't know and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you're a drug dealer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of got that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.09,0:13:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay in cash\Nand you use an alias, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.31,0:13:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a friend who worked for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.48,0:13:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,got murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my fault.\NI put him on that corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna smoke some crystal\Nand l just think you should go,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.99,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,being that you're in a program\Nand all and...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You could come with me\Nto a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.13,0:14:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.88,0:14:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,We could just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It won' t help.\NYeah, it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And l don't need you\Ntelling me that it won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.19,0:14:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, l really just need you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.25,0:15:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN SPEAKlNG IN SPANlSH]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir? Enjoy your meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.76,0:15:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.94,0:16:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[INDlSTlNCT CHATTER]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.80,0:16:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re, uh--\NWe' re in the big time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's the kingpin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.81,0:16:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your guess is as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.02,0:16:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you get the dude' s name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.65,0:16:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.\NHe's allowed to know all our names,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.11,0:16:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,what we look like,\Nbut not the other way around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.50,0:16:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don' t you get yourself\Nsome food?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.00,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So we won' t both sit here\Nwith our Happy Meals,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,looking like a couple chumps?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.34,0:17:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen,\Nis everything to your satisfaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing but an ankle-grab.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.76,0:17:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A week ago you talked like\Nyou were all ready to hang it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ve nearly got 40 pounds\Nwe still need to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.15,0:17:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what about after?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,After you gonna make up\Nsome new magic number?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.69,0:17:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "l got bills. I got bills.\NI gotta make more."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want me to say, Jesse?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.03,0:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Things have changed.\NOh, l know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.12,0:17:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We got a guy killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.58,0:17:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.71,0:17:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm out of here.\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NOh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.89,0:18:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's waking up from a nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.23,0:18:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She is certainly gonna wanna get out\Nand stretch those legs soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.57,0:18:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. We have to keep an eye\Non your fluids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.07,0:18:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re on the low side of normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.95,0:18:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What? How-- How low?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem unless we see\Na growth drop-off, so we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.08,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll have you in for\Nan ultrasound next week\Nand keep an eye on things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[KNOCK ON DOOR]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.13,0:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man,\Nyou would not believe the traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.09,0:18:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I left 40 minutes early.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.26,0:18:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Hi.\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.47,0:18:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT: What did l miss?\NFor your refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.81,0:18:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Look. Heh-heh.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,God. It's like she's here already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.27,0:18:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just telling Skyler\Neverything looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.07,0:18:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we've been talking\Nabout it for months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.61,0:18:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm gonna say,\Ndon't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The C-section? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:19:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's a yes,\Nwe need to schedule it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, my, uh, last labor\Nwas pretty tough, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.79,0:19:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For the baby, I say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l agree, considering that\Nyour fluids are on the low side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.63,0:19:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's best we take her\Na little early. So why don't\Nwe schedule it for
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.14,0:19:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,a week from Friday?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh. Isn't that a Friday the 1 3th?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.60,0:19:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.36,0:19:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm. The 1 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.07,0:19:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I like it.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, speaking of birthdays,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to run back to the office,\Nso l will see you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.99,0:19:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. lt's an hour before closing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re supposed to be\Ntaking it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re having a get-together\Nfor Ted's birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and l've gotta pick up the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.67,0:19:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I said I would?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.64,0:20:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the least I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?\NYeah, okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.\NBye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, go do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You know that museum in Santa Fe\Nyou talked about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.45,0:21:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.46,0:21:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.56,0:21:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot return that stock.\NIt's been drilled, it's been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re halfway through the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,WOMAN [OVER PA]:\NMr. Beneke to the shop, please.\NMr. Beneke to the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.57,0:21:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. Um...\NJust let me think about it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.20,0:21:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Dean, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.41,0:21:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,ALL:\NHappy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.30,0:21:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God. This is beautiful, guys.\NThank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.22,0:22:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry. These candles aren't gonna\Nhold out much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. You making a wish?\NYou gotta make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.98,0:22:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Hmm. Well, let's see.\NThe economy's in the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,China's undercutting us\Nat every turn.\NI'm at a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.57,0:22:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Skyler?\NYes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna hear it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.82,0:22:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. You cannot deny\Nyour employer his birthday wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, l can. Watch me.\NPlease!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.00,0:22:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is your birthday wish,\NI feel very, very sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. lt was so good last time.\NIt was ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.67,0:22:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And l'm enormous now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And l don't look anything\Nlike her anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.18,0:22:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that l ever did. I mean, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.68,0:22:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, these candles\Nare getting wax all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.31,0:22:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously.\NYes, come on, Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.27,0:22:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,ALL [CHANTlNG]:\NSkyler, Skyler, Skyler...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.31,0:22:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obscene.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.19,0:23:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, Skyler, Skyler...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.45,0:23:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[SINGING]\NHappy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.21,0:23:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.22,0:23:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, Mr. President
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.64,0:23:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Of Beneke Fabricators Incorporated
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[ALL LAUGH]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.56,0:23:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.07,0:23:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHEERS AND APPLAUSE]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.20,0:23:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.08,0:23:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she great, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.66,0:23:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.71,0:23:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHEERS AND APPLAUSE]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOUTHS WORDS]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.51,0:24:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\NHe wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.72,0:24:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,SAL [OVER PHONE]:\NOh, he was there, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.43,0:24:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?\NI sat there for two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.18,0:24:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody came.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.52,0:24:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,SAUL: All l know is my contact\Nsaid he was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.35,0:24:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you were\Nat the right restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.86,0:24:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where was he?\NWho knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.57,0:24:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he stayed out\Nin the parking lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.11,0:24:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,checked you out\Nwith a telephoto lens,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,didn' t like the cut of your jib.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it doesn't matter now\Nbecause my contact says it's a no-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.83,0:24:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.70,0:24:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No deal. No dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot at and missed. Shit on and hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.71,0:24:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.92,0:24:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How can he make that decision\Nwithout even meeting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.63,0:24:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, he's very cautious\Nwho he does business with,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.59,0:24:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's skittish, like a deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.30,0:24:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Call him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.89,0:24:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. l can' t do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can. Call him, Saul.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,First of all,\NI never called him, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I called a guy who called a guy\Nwho called a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.90,0:25:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Second of all, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.78,0:25:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?\NWith this particular individual,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.45,0:25:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,all you get is the one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.86,0:25:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[SIGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.07,0:25:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.49,0:25:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll see if I can scrape\Nsomething else together
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.33,0:25:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.29,0:25:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else handles\Nthat kind of bulk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.33,0:25:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.27,0:25:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.27,0:27:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy, you must remember to have\Nthe salt and pepper shakers wiped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.65,0:27:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.28,0:27:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Diet Coke, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.62,0:27:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And five minutes of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.05,0:27:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What can I do for you?\NHave a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.64,0:27:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.61,0:27:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to know why you wouldn' t\Nmeet with me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.20,0:28:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.95,0:28:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I sat here yesterday,\Nwaiting to meet with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.42,0:28:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe that person was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.33,0:28:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that you're confusing me\Nfor someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.96,0:28:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think l am.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.51,0:28:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you have a complaint,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.56,0:28:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you submit it\Nthrough our e-mail system.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.02,0:28:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I would be happy to refer you\Nto our website.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.02,0:28:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was told that the man\NI would be meeting with
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.15,0:28:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,is very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.65,0:28:35.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A cautious man.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.82,0:28:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe we' re alike in that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.45,0:28:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are who I think you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.66,0:28:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you should give me another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.84,0:28:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think we're alike at all,\NMr. White.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.51,0:29:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not a cautious man at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.51,0:29:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your partner was late\Nand he was high.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.68,0:29:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.23,0:29:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's high often, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.03,0:29:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You have poor judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.24,0:29:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't work with someone\Nwith poor judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.49,0:29:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with my product?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.24,0:29:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been told it's excellent.\NIt is impeccable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.08,0:29:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the purest,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.71,0:29:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,most chemically sound product\Non the market anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.38,0:29:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not the only factor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.92,0:29:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You could charge\Ntwice the current rate\Nfor what I provide,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.09,0:29:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and your customers would pay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.10,0:29:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.60,0:29:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, who I choose\Nto do business with on my end\Nis not your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.94,0:29:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.44,0:29:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't interact with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.78,0:30:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget he exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.86,0:30:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.99,0:30:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.29,0:30:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.46,0:30:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he does what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.75,0:30:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.88,0:30:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How much product\Ndo you have on hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.72,0:30:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.80,0:30:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to go at a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.69,0:30:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Will l hear from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.19,0:30:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I have your numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.78,0:30:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never trust a drug addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.84,0:31:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l mean, it's all kind of\Nlittle dribs and drabs,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.68,0:31:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but right here,\Ntake Keller, for instance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.06,0:31:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple hundred dollars here,\Na few thousand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.81,0:31:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dribs and drabs. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.56,0:31:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you add it all up, though,\Nwith Keller,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.86,0:31:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the revenues are almost 1 0 percent\Nless than was actually received.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.53,0:31:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is every quarter\Nfor the last two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.82,0:31:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.53,0:31:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When I saw that, l got worried\Nso l checked Accounts Receivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.50,0:31:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I found six other instances
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.67,0:31:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,of revenues being under-reported.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.21,0:31:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And l've only just started\Nto look into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.13,0:31:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We have requirement contracts\Nwith a lot of these companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.72,0:31:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They anticipate their needs\Nfor the next quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.18,0:31:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the time, they overestimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.26,0:31:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I let them roll their overages\Ninto the next order,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.89,0:31:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and if I don't, they' ll go elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.23,0:31:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, we forgot,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.06,0:32:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,or didn't go back\Nand adjust the revenue entries.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's wrong from an accounting\Nstandpoint, but as you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.74,0:32:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the money's coming in eventually,\Nas you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.45,0:32:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.16,0:32:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, but, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.83,0:32:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the old bills of sale\Nand order forms out of storage,\Nyou know,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.67,0:32:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,to try and sort this out. And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.17,0:32:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Most of the time, there's no backup\Nfor the reported revenues at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.63,0:32:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few cases,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.14,0:32:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I found xeroxed copies\Nwith the dates changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.44,0:32:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.94,0:32:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.32,0:32:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh. You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.87,0:32:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We' re talking nearly a million dollars\Nof undocumented revenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.21,0:33:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?\NI'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.55,0:33:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,about saving a company.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.92,0:33:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about people's jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,about their mortgages\Nand pensions,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.93,0:33:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,and their college funds\Nfor their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.06,0:33:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.47,0:33:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn' t mean that you have to\Nbreak the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.27,0:33:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it does, Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.15,0:33:22.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right there in the books.\NBusiness is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.27,0:33:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The bank is on my back,\Nthe IRS is grinding me down\Nto a nub.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If l don' t keep up--\NTed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.44,0:33:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,People go to prison for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.29,0:33:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad built this company\Nfrom nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.25,0:33:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We make things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.92,0:33:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who work here\Nare like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.51,0:33:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let that all fall apart\Nbecause of a couple of bad years.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.89,0:33:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.73,0:34:00.77,Default,,0,0,0,,don't report this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.73,0:34:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.57,0:34:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna turn you in, Ted.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.03,0:34:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't be a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.54,0:34:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.66,0:34:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. I just wish...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.04,0:34:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.88,0:34:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.89,0:34:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.44,0:34:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE [ON RECORDlNG]:\NYo, if l know you, leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.74,0:34:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,PETE: Yo, it' s Skinny Pete.\NJust checking in with you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.70,0:34:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We missed you at the funeral today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.74,0:34:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole crew was representing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.41,0:34:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Badger came\Nall the way from Fresno.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.58,0:35:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Combo's people, his ma,\Ngrandma, cousins,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.87,0:35:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone was all choked up\Nand shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.04,0:35:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it was, like, emotional.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.92,0:35:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you should have\Nseen the coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.09,0:35:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It was this shiny white pearlescent.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.17,0:35:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I' m sure l' ve seen the exact same\Npaint job on a Lexus, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.47,0:35:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're definitely talking high-end.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.64,0:35:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, guess you had something\Nbigger going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.06,0:35:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your back out there, bro.\NPeace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.65,0:36:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I like to mix some ice with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.15,0:36:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.20,0:37:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it feel like?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.33,0:37:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't freak out. It passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.04,0:37:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.55,0:37:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You' ll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.43,0:37:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.86,0:37:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.53,0:37:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.09,0:37:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[EXHALES]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.50,0:40:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE VIBRATlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.01,0:40:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Phones off, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.56,0:40:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE VIBRATlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.57,0:40:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pipes, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.82,0:40:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.\NEyes on your paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.20,0:40:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Eyes on your paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.38,0:40:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.11,0:41:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, where's the manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.82,0:41:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the manager. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.32,0:41:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.\NI met a man here last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.95,0:41:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a black gentleman.\NHe's thin. Glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.04,0:41:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. That's the owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.79,0:41:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, owner. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.83,0:41:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He owns 14 Los Pollos restaurants\Nin between here and Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.79,0:41:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be at any one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.25,0:41:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there a phone number\Nthat I can get to..?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.05,0:41:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir. I can't give that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.97,0:41:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this about a complaint?\NI'd be happy to refer you\Nto our website.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.26,0:41:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.31,0:41:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his name?\NGustavo.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.48,0:41:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gus.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.19,0:41:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.48,0:41:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-eight pounds, $1 .2 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.11,0:41:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Truck stop,\Ntwo miles south of Exit 1 3 on the 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.78,0:41:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour.\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.32,0:41:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour. You in or out?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.33,0:41:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In. ln. Absolutely.\NBut I just need a little more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.71,0:42:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,One hour. lf you miss it,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.92,0:42:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,don't ever show your face\Nin here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.59,0:42:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Exit 1 3 off the 25 South,\Nto a truck. Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.14,0:42:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE ON RECORDlNG]:\NYo, if l know you, leave a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.01,0:42:18.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse. Jesse, pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.02,0:42:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Pick up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.52,0:42:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming by. I need the product.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.61,0:42:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I need the product now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.71,0:42:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[GASPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.55,0:42:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.93,0:43:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.94,0:43:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.32,0:43:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,[PANTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.82,0:43:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.84,0:43:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.63,0:43:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.88,0:43:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.14,0:43:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE RINGS]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.82,0:43:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.95,0:44:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse. Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.83,0:44:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.46,0:44:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.76,0:44:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.39,0:44:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.44,0:44:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.81,0:44:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse. Jesse, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.61,0:44:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.03,0:44:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse. Jesse, wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.82,0:44:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.16,0:44:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.95,0:44:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.62,0:44:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.83,0:44:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the product?\NGet off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.79,0:44:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?\NWhere'd you hide the meth?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.87,0:44:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the kitchen.\NWhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.46,0:44:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Under the sink.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.34,0:44:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE RINGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.10,0:45:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.39,0:45:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE CHIMING]
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.90,0:45:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No, no, no.\NNot now, not now. Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.68,0:46:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.11,0:46:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS THEN SLAMS]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.95,0:46:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
